{ "version": 1, "title": "Scope Chain and Closures", "page": { "width": 1008.0, "height": 612.0, "margin": 36.0, "background": "#ffffff" }, "elements": [ { "type": "label", "id": "title", "x": 48.0, "y": 34.0, "text": "Scope Chain and Closures", "style": { "fill": null, "stroke": null, "stroke_width": null, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": null, "font_size": 30.0, "font_weight": 700, "italic": null, "text_color": null, "align": null, "padding": null } }, { "type": "label", "id": "sub", "x": 48.0, "y": 72.0, "text": "Lookup goes OUTWARD only. A closure is the link that survives after the outer call returns.", "style": { "fill": null, "stroke": null, "stroke_width": null, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": null, "font_size": 16.0, "font_weight": null, "italic": null, "text_color": "#6b6a66", "align": null, "padding": null } }, { "type": "shape", "id": "s1", "kind": "rect", "x": 48.0, "y": 118.0, "w": 430.0, "h": 336.0, "text": "", "style": { "fill": "none", "stroke": "#5b6672", "stroke_width": 2.0, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": null, "font_size": 16.0, "font_weight": 700, "italic": null, "text_color": null, "align": "left", "padding": 14.0 } }, { "type": "shape", "id": "s2", "kind": "rect", "x": 74.0, "y": 158.0, "w": 378.0, "h": 272.0, "text": "", "style": { "fill": "none", "stroke": "#2a78d6", "stroke_width": 2.0, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": null, "font_size": 15.0, "font_weight": 700, "italic": null, "text_color": null, "align": "left", "padding": 12.0 } }, { "type": "shape", "id": "v2", "kind": "rect", "x": 116.0, "y": 200.0, "w": 210.0, "h": 34.0, "text": "let count = 0", "style": { "fill": "#e3edfb", "stroke": "#2a78d6", "stroke_width": null, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": "mono", "font_size": 14.0, "font_weight": null, "italic": null, "text_color": "#10386b", "align": null, "padding": null } }, { "type": "shape", "id": "s3", "kind": "rect", "x": 100.0, "y": 250.0, "w": 326.0, "h": 158.0, "text": "", "style": { "fill": "none", "stroke": "#d9541f", "stroke_width": 2.0, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": null, "font_size": 15.0, "font_weight": 700, "italic": null, "text_color": null, "align": "left", "padding": 12.0 } }, { "type": "shape", "id": "v3", "kind": "rect", "x": 142.0, "y": 292.0, "w": 210.0, "h": 34.0, "text": "count += 1", "style": { "fill": "#fce6da", "stroke": "#d9541f", "stroke_width": null, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": "mono", "font_size": 14.0, "font_weight": null, "italic": null, "text_color": "#7a2f0f", "align": null, "padding": null } }, { "type": "label", "id": "arrowsnote", "x": 48.0, "y": 466.0, "text": "Lookup never goes inward: the outer scope cannot see anything
declared inside, and two sibling scopes cannot see each other.", "w": 430.0, "style": { "fill": null, "stroke": null, "stroke_width": null, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": null, "font_size": 13.0, "font_weight": null, "italic": null, "text_color": "#6b6a66", "align": null, "padding": null } }, { "type": "shape", "id": "cl", "kind": "rect", "x": 528.0, "y": 122.0, "w": 432.0, "h": 40.0, "text": "After makeCounter() returns", "style": { "fill": "#d9f2e9", "stroke": "#0f8f63", "stroke_width": null, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": null, "font_size": 17.0, "font_weight": 700, "italic": null, "text_color": "#0a4d36", "align": null, "padding": null } }, { "type": "shape", "id": "cl1", "kind": "rect", "x": 528.0, "y": 176.0, "w": 432.0, "h": 90.0, "text": "The makeCounter() frame is gone from the stack,
but the returned function still holds its scope link,
so count is kept alive and stays private.", "style": { "fill": "#ffffff", "stroke": "#0f8f63", "stroke_width": null, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": null, "font_size": 14.0, "font_weight": null, "italic": null, "text_color": null, "align": "left", "padding": null } }, { "type": "shape", "id": "cl2", "kind": "rect", "x": 528.0, "y": 286.0, "w": 432.0, "h": 106.0, "text": "const a = makeCounter();
const b = makeCounter();
a(); a(); // 1, 2
b(); // 1 - its own count", "style": { "fill": "#ffffff", "stroke": "#5b6672", "stroke_width": null, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": "mono", "font_size": 14.0, "font_weight": null, "italic": null, "text_color": null, "align": "left", "padding": null } }, { "type": "shape", "id": "cl3", "kind": "note", "x": 528.0, "y": 412.0, "w": 432.0, "h": 92.0, "text": "Every call to the outer function makes a NEW scope, so a and b
capture two independent counts. That is how closures give you
private state without a class.", "style": { "fill": "#fbeecf", "stroke": "#b07d00", "stroke_width": null, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": null, "font_size": 14.0, "font_weight": null, "italic": null, "text_color": "#5c4100", "align": "left", "padding": null } }, { "type": "label", "id": "l1", "x": 62.0, "y": 128.0, "text": "Global scope", "style": { "fill": null, "stroke": null, "stroke_width": null, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": null, "font_size": 15.0, "font_weight": 700, "italic": null, "text_color": "#25303a", "align": null, "padding": null } }, { "type": "label", "id": "l2", "x": 88.0, "y": 168.0, "text": "makeCounter() scope", "style": { "fill": null, "stroke": null, "stroke_width": null, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": null, "font_size": 15.0, "font_weight": 700, "italic": null, "text_color": "#10386b", "align": null, "padding": null } }, { "type": "label", "id": "l3", "x": 114.0, "y": 260.0, "text": "inner function scope", "style": { "fill": null, "stroke": null, "stroke_width": null, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": null, "font_size": 15.0, "font_weight": 700, "italic": null, "text_color": "#7a2f0f", "align": null, "padding": null } }, { "type": "connector", "id": "conn3", "from": "v3", "to": "v2", "from_side": "top", "to_side": "bottom", "route": "straight", "style": { "fill": null, "stroke": "#d9541f", "stroke_width": 2.0, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": null, "font_size": null, "font_weight": null, "italic": null, "text_color": null, "align": null, "padding": null } }, { "type": "label", "id": "lookup3", "x": 142.0, "y": 344.0, "text": "not found here:
look OUTWARD", "w": 150.0, "style": { "fill": null, "stroke": null, "stroke_width": null, "dash": null, "opacity": null, "corner_radius": null, "font": null, "font_size": 13.0, "font_weight": 700, "italic": null, "text_color": "#7a2f0f", "align": "left", "padding": null } } ], "next_id": { "conn": 3 } }
